    "复制未完成，清理也失败了。原文件仍保留，请检查目标位置和未完成的分片上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The copy did not finish, and cleanup also failed. The original file is intact. Check the destination and incomplete multipart uploads."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制未完成，清理也失败了。原文件仍保留，请检查目标位置和未完成的分片上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
